      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The intent of this function is to satisfy the InstallableModule interface \n\nWill this interface be used for API surface enforcements? If so, maybe one option might be to rename `IsInstallableModule` to `EnforceApiContainerChecks`.\n\nimo, this will make this function less ambiguous for cases like such\n```\njava_library {\n   name: \"foo\",\n   installable: false,\n   apex_available: [\"//apex_available:platform\"],\n}\n``` \n\nIn the current implementation, `foo` has\n1. IsInstallableModule: true\n2. IsInstallable: false",
